{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>We are all sons of one man.</b> Had we been spies, we would have been sent by the command of some king, and his officers would not choose all the spies from the sons of one man; rather, we came together because we are brothers." "<b>Honest men we are.</b> In all our dealings." "<b>Your servants were never spies.</b> Ever; nor is it fitting to suspect us of espionage now."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 42, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:34:15.859785286Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}